<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/20/msa@/~cl_8> <https://schema.org/text> "Akta ibu dipinda dengan memasukkan selepas seksyen 15 seksyen yang berikut: “Power to amend Schedules 15a. The Minister may, by order published in the Gazette, amend the Schedules to this Act.”. Jadual baharu"@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/20/msa@> .
